  "abstract": "Research infrastructure presenting a bounded English-language corpus of EU artificial intelligence policy documents and their evidence-bearing metadata. Version 0.1.0 contains 187 published records, including four explicitly qualified records pending expanded evidence review. Twelve additional candidates remain unpublished. The coverage cutoff is 4 September 2026; the release-time evidence review is dated 6 September 2026. This dataset does not claim exhaustive coverage or legal authority.",
